What the hell happened here? ==================================================================
What the hell happened here? lib.memeasm - helpers shared by every module of the self-hosted compiler
What the hell happened here? Calling convention (see DESIGN.md): arguments in rdi, rsi, rdx, rcx; result in rax.
What the hell happened here? rax rcx rdx rsi rdi r8-r11 may be clobbered, rbx rbp r12-r14 are preserved, r15 = global block.
What the hell happened here? Monke label prefix of this file: auaa. Edition prefix: lib.
What the hell happened here? ==================================================================


